There is no evidence that Russia is importing gas, either natural or gasoline. Some rags claim that they do, based on "sources", that provide zero evidence or even details. Not to mention whole idea of Russia having to import fuel from "Asia" by sea is asinine. It is pretty much guaranteed propaganda for simpletons, that do not understand how whole industry operates.
